   165	returns -5, while 50 queries with K=50 returns +115. That result supports only
   166	this conditional statement: aliases can be positive when the model's discovery
   167	cost is amortized over sufficiently many remembered queries. It does not measure
   168	a typical agent session or a transport comparison.
   169	
   170	The simple all-data-query amortization check for the model's 85-token and
